      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NICCY'S AFFAIR (2) is the one to beat after putting a BM58+ field away by just over four lengths at this track first-up, with DIABLO LAD behind her in second. It's hard to think anything can turn the tables on her from that effort with this shaping favourably. Can repeat the dose. CAPRICIOUS RULER (6) is the main danger after a sound fourth in CL2 company, beaten just under four lengths, and she gets weight relief while retaining enough recent form to threaten. DIABLO LAD (5) was no match for NICCY'S AFFAIR but did enough first-up to stay under notice, especially after a good 1 Metro Win fifth at Belmont before the break. MAKIN PROPHETS (1) resumes after eight months and has a fitness query, but his closing runs in BM58+ and 1 Metro Win company last campaign give him a genuine place platform if ready. KAMAKAZI SHOOTER (8) can play a role.",
